---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import BlogPostLayout from '../../components/BlogPostLayout.astro';
import { site, categories, orderCatalog, itemCartId, deliverySlabLine, lateNightTimeRange } from '../../lib/data';
import { abs, blogPostingJsonLd, breadcrumbJsonLd } from '../../lib/seo';
const headline = 'Late-Night Food & Charges | The Oven Vibe Sundargarh';
const description = 'Our actual late-night menu rules, kitchen reopen charge, delivery rates and advance-payment steps for direct orders in Sundargarh.';
const path = '/blog/late-night-food/';
const image = {url:abs('/static/images/og/blog_3.jpg'),width:1200,height:630,alt:'The Oven Vibe food photograph'};
const lateCategories=categories.filter(c=>c.items.some(i=>orderCatalog.find(r=>r.id===itemCartId(i.product_code))?.lateNight)).map(c=>c.name);
---
<Layout title={headline} description={description} ogType="article" image={image} jsonLd={[blogPostingJsonLd({headline,description,path,image:image.url,datePublished:'2024-05-25',dateModified:'2026-10-17'}),breadcrumbJsonLd([{name:'Blog',path:'/blog/'},{name:headline,path}])]}>
 <BlogPostLayout line1='LATE-NIGHT' lineGradient='ORDERS.' subtitle='Check what is available and what the final quote includes.'>
  <picture><source type="image/avif" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_3.avif"/><source type="image/webp" srcset="/static/images/blog_images/blog_3.webp"/><img src="/static/images/blog_images/blog_3.webp" alt="The Oven Vibe food photograph" class="blog-img" loading="lazy" width="1024" height="1024"/></picture>

  <p>The Oven Vibe's normal hours are {site.business.hours.display}. The separate late-night window runs {lateNightTimeRange}. It has its own availability and payment conditions, so an old daytime quote should not be reused for a late order.</p>
  <h2>What can I order late?</h2><p>{site.delivery.late_night.menu_note} Categories with items marked for this window are {lateCategories.join(', ')}. The actual menu and kitchen confirmation control availability; a category does not guarantee every individual item is available.</p>
  <h2>Why does the quote include a kitchen charge?</h2><p>{site.delivery.late_night.note} One <strong>₹{site.delivery.late_night.kitchen_charge} kitchen reopen charge</strong> applies per order, including pickup. It is separate from delivery, rather than a second delivery charge.</p>
  <h2>Delivery, pickup and rain</h2><ul><li>Delivery uses the normal distance rates: {deliverySlabLine}. There is no free-delivery threshold late at night.</li><li>Pickup has no delivery or rain charge, but still includes the kitchen reopen charge.</li><li>An applicable delivery rain charge is ₹{site.delivery.rain.surcharge}. Read the final quote rather than adding it a second time yourself.</li></ul>
  <h2>How to place a late-night order</h2><ol><li>Choose the items and actual time in the <a href="/price-calculator/">price calculator</a>.</li><li>Select pickup or the correct delivery distance and review every charge.</li><li>Send the quote to the kitchen through the website's order flow and wait for confirmation and payment instructions.</li><li>Pay the full final quoted total in advance. The kitchen verifies receipt before accepting the late-night order.</li></ol>
  <p>There is no payment gateway on this site. A sent WhatsApp message or a checked box is not proof of acceptance or payment. For a scheduled order, choose pre-order and allow at least {site.delivery.preorder.min_hours_ahead} hours' notice.</p>

  <p><a href="/choose/">Compare ingredients, serving sizes and combos</a>, <a href="/menu/">browse the full menu</a>, or <a href="/faq/">read the ordering answers</a>.</p>
 </BlogPostLayout>
</Layout>
